WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.853
[Kelly] What's one time, like
a stranger changed your life.

00:00:04.580 --> 00:00:06.500
- You know, there was
this experience I had

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:08.000
where I was going through a really, really

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:09.200
tough season in life

00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:12.140
and I went to like the Glendale Galleria,

00:00:12.140 --> 00:00:16.040
and I was walking around by
myself and this young man,

00:00:16.040 --> 00:00:17.730
you know, I had to have
been like, I don't know,

00:00:17.730 --> 00:00:19.970
maybe 24 or something like that

00:00:19.970 --> 00:00:22.160
and he must've been like 19,

00:00:22.160 --> 00:00:24.910
he walked up to me and he
said to me, he was like,

00:00:24.910 --> 00:00:27.670
can I pray for you? And
I was like, oh my gosh.

00:00:27.670 --> 00:00:30.330
I was like, yeah, yeah,
I would totally love that

00:00:30.330 --> 00:00:32.590
and so we ended up
praying inside the mall,

00:00:32.590 --> 00:00:35.260
in the middle of the
mall and then afterwards,

00:00:35.260 --> 00:00:37.760
when I was walking to my
car, I was like, you know,

00:00:37.760 --> 00:00:39.590
are you good? Do you have a ride home?

00:00:39.590 --> 00:00:40.850
And he was like, well, you know,

00:00:40.850 --> 00:00:43.063
I got one I'm working on it.
And I was like, oh, well,

00:00:43.063 --> 00:00:44.010
if you want, I can give you a ride home

00:00:44.010 --> 00:00:46.630
which of course at 24, at 39,

00:00:46.630 --> 00:00:48.860
I wouldn't give anybody a
ride home that I don't know,

00:00:48.860 --> 00:00:51.710
but at 24 I was just like, yeah, sure

00:00:51.710 --> 00:00:52.770
if you need a ride, duh duh duh

00:00:52.770 --> 00:00:55.640
and so we ended up sitting in my car

00:00:55.640 --> 00:00:57.860
and then we ended up praying again

00:00:57.860 --> 00:01:00.470
and then I ended up praying over him

00:01:00.470 --> 00:01:02.930
and I just felt like a
bunch of stuff in my spirit

00:01:02.930 --> 00:01:05.960
that it just had to be
God put it in my spirit

00:01:05.960 --> 00:01:07.561
to just tell him about his life

00:01:07.561 --> 00:01:10.080
and then we both ended up crying.

00:01:10.080 --> 00:01:10.913
- wow

00:01:10.913 --> 00:01:12.550
- Then he was like, you know,
afterwards, he was like,

00:01:12.550 --> 00:01:14.420
okay, well, my ride's here
and I was like, well, let me,

00:01:14.420 --> 00:01:15.400
let me get your number, you know?

00:01:15.400 --> 00:01:19.310
So I got his number and I
plugged it in my phone as angel

00:01:19.310 --> 00:01:21.960
and I went home and like
two days later I told my

00:01:21.960 --> 00:01:24.240
girlfriends about it and
I just thought to myself,

00:01:24.240 --> 00:01:25.900
you know what? Like, I want
to give this guy a call

00:01:25.900 --> 00:01:26.960
and see how he's doing

00:01:26.960 --> 00:01:28.630
and I went through my phone

00:01:28.630 --> 00:01:31.470
and there was no angel in my phone at all.

00:01:31.470 --> 00:01:33.020
- Like it was gone like then,

00:01:33.020 --> 00:01:33.853
like you put it in and it was gone?

00:01:33.853 --> 00:01:34.686
[Megan] It was gone.

00:01:34.686 --> 00:01:35.519
- What?

00:01:35.519 --> 00:01:37.112
- Yeah, yeah.

00:01:37.112 --> 00:01:38.650
- Oh my gosh, so wait,

00:01:38.650 --> 00:01:40.720
I wait, so I have a similar experience.

00:01:40.720 --> 00:01:42.350
It's different but I just mean in the fact

00:01:42.350 --> 00:01:44.310
that like someone was there
and then they were gone.

00:01:44.310 --> 00:01:47.850
Like I was, it was the first
time I got up to sing a solo.

00:01:47.850 --> 00:01:49.660
It was like a dessert theater
or something at our school

00:01:49.660 --> 00:01:52.030
in like junior high and I,

00:01:52.030 --> 00:01:53.890
it was the first time I
did something and I did it

00:01:53.890 --> 00:01:56.540
and that show ended and, there were

00:01:56.540 --> 00:01:57.560
a lot of different performers,

00:01:57.560 --> 00:01:59.530
all their families were there
or whatever, grandparents,

00:01:59.530 --> 00:02:00.363
all that kind of stuff.

00:02:00.363 --> 00:02:01.410
And this older man,

00:02:01.410 --> 00:02:03.238
like really old, like, dude,

00:02:03.238 --> 00:02:05.550
like came up to me and I was actually,

00:02:05.550 --> 00:02:06.830
this is such a weird thing about me,

00:02:06.830 --> 00:02:08.220
but I didn't grow up around older people

00:02:08.220 --> 00:02:10.224
and so I used to, when I
was a kid be terrified,

00:02:10.224 --> 00:02:11.950
like I would get so panicked,

00:02:11.950 --> 00:02:12.783
- Oh wow

00:02:12.783 --> 00:02:13.900
- It just scared me

00:02:13.900 --> 00:02:16.220
and I just didn't grow
up around anyone old.

00:02:16.220 --> 00:02:18.218
So like I never saw and so it scared me.

00:02:18.218 --> 00:02:19.970
So when he came up and talked to me,

00:02:19.970 --> 00:02:23.305
I was just kind of frozen, but
he said the weirdest thing,

00:02:23.305 --> 00:02:25.790
he said, all he said was,

00:02:25.790 --> 00:02:27.900
you're going to do this
for the rest of your life.

00:02:27.900 --> 00:02:29.830
And I was like, and I,
and I was like, what?

00:02:29.830 --> 00:02:31.731
And I was so panicked. I
wasn't really, I was really,

00:02:31.731 --> 00:02:32.608
[Megan] wow

00:02:32.608 --> 00:02:33.820
- I was just like, run, run.

00:02:33.820 --> 00:02:35.080
Like, I was like so scared.

00:02:35.080 --> 00:02:39.080
And so I walked away and then
I felt horrible because I was

00:02:39.080 --> 00:02:40.460
like, ugh, did I say, thank you?

00:02:40.460 --> 00:02:41.293
And I was like,

00:02:41.293 --> 00:02:42.670
and so then I started looking around

00:02:42.670 --> 00:02:44.523
and I was looking for this
man and I couldn't find him.

00:02:44.523 --> 00:02:46.690
I asked everyone there. Oh, it was like,

00:02:46.690 --> 00:02:48.860
someone's grandpa was
here and like, came up,

00:02:48.860 --> 00:02:51.010
no one had seen him.

00:02:51.010 --> 00:02:52.410
I explained what he was wearing.

00:02:52.410 --> 00:02:54.840
Nobody. And I never got to say, thank you.

00:02:54.840 --> 00:02:56.060
So I don't know, if he was just

00:02:56.060 --> 00:02:57.250
some old random dude that came in

00:02:57.250 --> 00:03:00.000
or like, if he exists, I don't know.

00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:00.833
I was like, what?

00:03:00.833 --> 00:03:02.718
[Megan] Right. Anyway, it
was the weirdest thing ever

00:03:02.718 --> 00:03:04.020
and then, you know, then
I, yeah, I'm a singer.

00:03:04.020 --> 00:03:06.554
So anyway, it was, that's so
weird when stuff like that,

00:03:06.554 --> 00:03:07.387
- That's crazy, I got chills

00:03:07.387 --> 00:03:08.580
when you were telling that story.

00:03:08.580 --> 00:03:09.540
- No, I'm telling you

00:03:09.540 --> 00:03:11.430
and I got scared cause I was such,

00:03:11.430 --> 00:03:13.293
I guess I was a very scared kid.

00:03:13.293 --> 00:03:15.321
(Kelly laughs) In in a lot
of aspects. I got scared

00:03:15.321 --> 00:03:17.287
cause I was like, well
then where did he go?

00:03:17.287 --> 00:03:18.624
(Kelly chuckles)

00:03:18.624 --> 00:03:19.457
Like, but it was,

00:03:19.457 --> 00:03:20.290
[Meagan] Right

00:03:20.290 --> 00:03:21.280
- but then I kind of, I'm
also a spiritual person,

00:03:21.280 --> 00:03:23.150
I was like, was that like an angel?

00:03:23.150 --> 00:03:24.560
Like I was like, was
that like somebody, like,

00:03:24.560 --> 00:03:26.270
I don't know that if you
believe in it or not,

00:03:26.270 --> 00:03:27.103
I just, it happened.

00:03:27.103 --> 00:03:27.936
- I do

